#: ../../../ign_docker_env.md:1
msgid "Dockerized Development on Ubuntu"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ign_docker_env.md:3
msgid ""
"These instructions are meant for advanced users, and currently do not "
"include all steps to copy-and-paste. These instructions apply to [Ubuntu]"
"(https://hub.docker.com/_/ubuntu) as the base image. These instructions "
"create a Ubuntu Docker container ready for building, testing and running "
"Ignition."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ign_docker_env.md:7
msgid "Install tools"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ign_docker_env.md:9
msgid ""
"An off-the-shelf Docker container for development of Ignition is not "
"available. https://github.com/ignition-tooling/gzdev provides tooling to "
"build such a container for you. The following tools are required to be "
"installed on the host machine:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ign_docker_env.md:13
msgid ""
"git - If not already installed consider [Ubuntu Binary Install]"
"(install_ubuntu)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ign_docker_env.md:14
msgid ""
"Docker - If not already installed consider [Ubuntu Source Install]"
"(install_ubuntu_src)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ign_docker_env.md:15
msgid ""
"gzdev - [ignition-tooling/gzdev](https://github.com/ignition-tooling/gzdev)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ign_docker_env.md:16
msgid "vcstool - [dirk-thomas/vcstool](https://github.com/dirk-thomas/vcstool)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ign_docker_env.md:18
msgid "Using gzdev ign-docker-env"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ign_docker_env.md:20
msgid ""
"Detailed instructions are available in the [gzdev repository](https://github."
"com/ignition-tooling/gzdev#using-ign-docker-env-to-build-ignition-"
"repositories-from-source)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ign_docker_env.md:22
msgid "High level instructions:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ign_docker_env.md:24
msgid ""
"Create a workspace with the source to mount into a container using `vcstool`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ign_docker_env.md:25
msgid ""
"Use `gzdev ign-docker-env` to build and start a container with `--vol` "
"pointing to the previously created workspace"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../ign_docker_env.md:26
msgid ""
"See [Ubuntu Source Install section on building](install_ubuntu_src."
"md#building-the-ignition-libraries) for instructions to work with a source "
"install"
msgstr ""

